{"id":"n62151-1-7","stage":4,"title":"삭막하다 · 荒凉","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62151-1-7-1","ko":"이 도시에서는 콘크리트 건물들만 보이네.","zh":"在这个城市里，只能看到混凝土建筑啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"도시에서는","meaning":"都市，城市","explanation":"도시：都市，城市；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"도시","audio":"/audio/abbc940f03792a890e5d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70743","senseId":"1","lemma":"도시","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"도시에서는","audio":"/audio/348316e70a8ff74fd0d3.mp3"}},{"text":"콘크리트","meaning":"混凝土","explanation":"콘크리트：混凝土","readings":[{"term":"콘크리트","audio":"/audio/609cc8164e1884de7304.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"81247","senseId":"1","lemma":"콘크리트","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"콘크리트","audio":"/audio/609cc8164e1884de7304.mp3"}},{"text":"건물들만","meaning":"建筑，建筑物","explanation":"건물：建筑，建筑物；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"건물","audio":"/audio/51a9489f74ea88e7bf4d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28029","senseId":"1","lemma":"건물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"건물들만","audio":"/audio/705b14eda36479c766e2.mp3"}},{"text":"보이네.","meaning":"可见，看得到","explanation":"보이다：可见，看得到；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"보이다","audio":"/audio/da6f27438e6f345c1e87.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62091","senseId":"3","lemma":"보이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보이네","audio":"/audio/3e5827b860b431fd1899.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id